	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AvHlubFuDSexKF1nH",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 7, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 11, HP 7, WILL 10, PER 12, FP 9, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 10, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AuZxtBZLzAF69pZAo",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 10 (offense 5, protection 5), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "A93gXHpvO1fwkIIDT",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/monitor-lizard.gct"
		},
		{
