			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "A5PSz6oX8SvCbJJRg",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "ALjv3tGzpl8BhBBrb",
			"text": "Antocoagulant (follow-up on Bite): Affliction 1 (HT; Biological (Passive), -5%; Disadvantage, Hemophilia, +30%; Extended Duration, 30x, +60%; Follow-Up, Bite, +0%) Resolve as stated by the construction; the source gives no separate resolution text."
		},
